    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116082" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦκα</span></b> , poet. Adv. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠκύς,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>quickly, swiftly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.402
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.88
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				6.317
			</span></i>, etc.; strengthd., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάλ᾽ ὦ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.52
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.8
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ. μάλ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					17.190
				</span></i>
			, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of Time, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ. δ᾽ ἔπειτα</span>”
