				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					17.329
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.527
			</span></i>, al.:—Cleitorian (<i><span class="en">
				Arc.
			</span></i>) word acc. to <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				1096
			</span></i>.</div>
